sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Student
  participant Web as Next.js Web
  participant Api as DiscussionController
  participant Service as DiscussionService
  participant Access as CourseAccessService
  participant Repo as DiscussionRepository
  participant Notify as NotificationService

  Student->>Web: Write discussion comment
  Web->>Api: POST /api/v1/discussions/{discussionId}/comments
  Api->>Service: addComment(userId, request)
  Service->>Access: Require discussion access
  Service->>Service: Validate content and moderation rules
  Service->>Repo: Save comment
  Service->>Notify: Notify discussion participants
  Service-->>Api: DiscussionCommentResponse
  Api-->>Web: 201 Created
  Web-->>Student: Append comment
